People are Mina, Owen, Priya, Jules, Ken.

| category | what is in it | arms |
| --- | --- | --- |
| arith | add and sub at 20, 100, 1,000, 4,096 digits; mul 12×12 and 50×50; 2^200; 50!; commas, negatives, leading zeros | clock |
| state | mug swaps at 8, 50, 200, 1,000; bank 200 transactions and a clipped bank; elevator; light toggles; robot grid; facing | clock |
